         ---------------------------------------------------------

               C N E T - T O P  U P / D O W N L O A D E R S

                 Version 1.1 by Raff Nixx / United Forces

         ---------------------------------------------------------


        This is a C-File for the C-Net BBS System which provides a
                          TOP UP/DOWNLOADERS LIST


You may call this one in the log-in procedure or whereever you want.
TopUpDn displays a top uploaders AND downloaders list side by side, so
your users don't have to browse through thousands of top-whatever-charts.

Version 1.1 has the great ability to configure the complete outfit of
the chart. There is a Header, Format and Footer file
("S:UFO/TopUpDn.Header","S:UFO/TopUpDn.Formats" and "S:UFO/TopUpDn.Footer")
where you may draw your own header, footer and chart outfit! I did put
them into a seperate subdirectory within your S: directory, coz' everyone
is putting it's configuration files here, so it's just for keeping some
order.

Take a look at the example files to see how it works. It should not be
that difficult for you to change it.


I hate typing docs...

 Bye, Raff Nixx / United Forces.


